{
  "strings": [
    {
      "key": "tutorial1Text",
      "text_en": "Today you are pet-sitting for a friend while they are out of town.",
      "text_es": "Spanish"
    },
    {
      "key": "tutorial2Text",
      "text_en": "But you just heard on the news that a fire has started in your area.",
      "text_es": "Spanish"
    },
    {
      "key": "tutorial3Text",
      "text_en": "You can't reach your friend because they are not answering their phone.",
      "text_es": "Spanish"
    },
    {
      "key": "tutorial4Text",
      "text_en": "Even though there is not an evacuation notice yet, you know that things can change quickly.",
      "text_es": "Spanish"
    },
    {
      "key": "tutorial5Text",
      "text_en": "You know how hard it would be for your friend if their belongings were lost in a fire.",
      "text_es": "Spanish"
    },
    {
      "key": "tutorial6Text",
      "text_en": "It's always best to be prepared, so try to gather the things you think would be important, just in case.",
      "text_es": "Spanish"
    },
    {
      "key": "tutorial7Text",
      "text_en": "Remember practical things like pets and pet food, water, and prescriptions, but also sentimental things like photo albums.",
      "text_es": "Spanish"
    },
    {
      "key": "tutorial8Text",
      "text_en": "Even though you have time now, remember if an evacuation notice happens you need to get out as quickly as possible and can't stop for non-essentials.",
      "text_es": "Spanish"
    },
    {
      "key": "tutorial9Text",
      "text_en": "Here's a map of your friend's house to help you get oriented. Good luck!",
      "text_es": "Spanish"
    },
